## Proposed Enhancements

To make the course creation experience "premium" and more functional, I suggest adding:

1.  **Live Preview Card**: As the instructor types the title and price, a "preview card" updates in real-time so they see exactly how it will look in the student marketplace.
2.  **Thumbnail Placeholder Generation**: Integrate the `generate_image` tool logic (or a high-end placeholder) so the course doesn't look empty.
3.  **Modern Form Layout**: Use a split-screen layout (Form on the left, Preview on the right) for a desktop-first "Studio" feel.
4.  **Category Selection**: Add a dropdown for categories (Web Dev, AI, Design, etc.) to improve filtering later.

